#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:6
msgid "Capturing sensor frames during training"
msgstr "在训练期间采集传感器帧"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:8
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports saving image-like outputs from scene sensors during "
"training using the ``CaptureEnvSensors`` Gymnasium wrapper. When "
"``--capture_env_sensors`` is set to a positive value, Isaac Lab iterates "
"over the environment's :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene` sensors and"
" writes each sensor's ``data.output`` tensors (for example, ``rgb``, "
"``depth``, or ``normals`` from a :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Camera`). The "
"flag value is the number of parallel environment views to tile into each "
"saved frame grid. This differs from :doc:`/source/features/record_video`, "
"which records a single perspective viewport clip of the scene."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持通过 ``CaptureEnvSensors`` Gymnasium 包装器，在训练期间保存场景传感器的图像类输出。将 "
"``--capture_env_sensors`` 设为正值后，Isaac Lab 会遍历环境的 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveScene` 传感器，并写出各传感器的 ``data.output`` 张量（例如"
" :class:`~isaaclab.sensors.Camera` 的 ``rgb`` 、 ``depth`` 或 ``normals`` "
"）。该参数值指定每张保存的帧网格中拼接的并行环境视图数量。这与 :doc:`/source/features/record_video` "
"不同，后者录制场景中单一透视视口的视频片段。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:16
msgid ""
"The capture flags are registered on the shared training entrypoints for RSL-"
"RL, RL-Games, Stable Baselines3, and skrl. They are not available on "
"``play`` scripts."
msgstr ""
"采集参数已注册到 RSL-RL、RL-Games、Stable Baselines3 和 skrl 的共享训练入口中， ``play`` "
"脚本不支持这些参数。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:19
msgid ""
"This feature can be enabled using the following command line arguments with "
"``./isaaclab.sh train``:"
msgstr "使用 ``./isaaclab.sh train`` 时，可通过以下命令行参数启用此功能："

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:22
msgid ""
"``--capture_env_sensors``: number of parallel environments to include in "
"each saved frame grid (default: ``0``, which disables capture)"
msgstr "``--capture_env_sensors`` ：每张保存的帧网格包含的并行环境数量（默认 ``0`` ，表示禁用采集）"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:24
msgid ""
"``--capture_env_sensors_length``: length of each captured sensor frame "
"window in **per-episode** steps (default: ``200``). Set to ``0`` to disable "
"saving even when ``--capture_env_sensors`` is positive."
msgstr ""
"``--capture_env_sensors_length`` ：每个传感器帧采集窗口的长度，以 **每回合内的** 步数计（默认 ``200`` "
"）。设为 ``0`` 时，即使 ``--capture_env_sensors`` 为正值，也不会保存。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:27
msgid ""
"``--capture_env_sensors_interval``: interval between captured sensor frame "
"windows in **per-episode** steps (default: ``2000``)"
msgstr ""
"``--capture_env_sensors_interval`` ：传感器帧采集窗口之间的间隔，以 **每回合内的** 步数计（默认 "
"``2000`` ）"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:29
msgid ""
"``--capture_env_sensors_format``: output format, either ``tensorboard`` "
"(default) or ``file``"
msgstr ""
"``--capture_env_sensors_format`` ：输出格式，为 ``tensorboard`` （默认）或 ``file``"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:31
msgid ""
"Enabling sensor capture automatically enables camera rendering during "
"training, the same as ``--video``, which slows down both startup and runtime"
" performance. Sensor capture can also be used at the same time as "
"``--video`` when both per-sensor frames and a perspective viewport clip are "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"启用传感器采集会自动开启训练中的相机渲染，与 ``--video`` "
"相同，因此启动和运行速度都会降低。如果既需要逐传感器帧，又需要透视视口视频片段，可以同时使用传感器采集和 ``--video`` 。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:36
msgid "Example usage:"
msgstr "示例用法: "

