#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:54
msgid ""
"The captured frames will be saved in the same directory as the training "
"checkpoints, under ``logs/<rl_workflow>/<task>/<run>/sensor_frames/train``. "
"Here ``<run>`` is the training run directory (the same timestamped folder "
"used for checkpoints and ``run.json``), not the per-episode index used in "
"output tags and file names."
msgstr ""
"采集的帧与训练检查点保存在同一目录下，具体位置为 "
"``logs/<rl_workflow>/<task>/<run>/sensor_frames/train`` 。其中 ``<run>`` "
"是本次训练的运行目录（即保存检查点和 ``run.json`` 的带时间戳文件夹），不是输出标签和文件名中使用的回合索引。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:61
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:63
msgid ""
"The sensor capture feature wraps the training environment through "
"``wrap_sensor_capture`` in ``isaaclab_rl.entrypoints.common`` and saves "
"frames on reset and step when the current **per-episode** step falls inside "
"a capture window. For each image-like scene sensor, the wrapper:"
msgstr ""
"传感器采集功能通过 ``isaaclab_rl.entrypoints.common`` 中的 ``wrap_sensor_capture`` "
"包装训练环境。当当前 **回合内的** 步数落在采集窗口内时，在重置和步进时保存帧。对每个具有图像类输出的场景传感器，该包装器会："

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:67
msgid ""
"reads ``sensor.data.output`` and skips sensors whose output is not a "
"dictionary of tensors"
msgstr "读取 ``sensor.data.output`` ，跳过输出不是张量字典的传感器"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:68
msgid ""
"resolves each output to a :class:`torch.Tensor`, including "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` buffers through their ``.torch`` "
"accessor"
msgstr ""
"将各输出解析为 :class:`torch.Tensor` ，其中 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` "
"缓冲区通过 ``.torch`` 访问器读取"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:70
msgid ""
"selects the first ``capture_num_envs`` parallel environments from each "
"tensor"
msgstr "从各张量中选取前 ``capture_num_envs`` 个并行环境"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:71
msgid "replaces non-finite values with zero before display normalization"
msgstr "在显示归一化前，将非有限值替换为零"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:72
msgid ""
"normalizes each output for display using "
":func:`~isaaclab.utils.images.normalize_camera_output_for_display` and tiles"
" the selected views into a single image grid with "
":func:`~isaaclab.utils.images.make_camera_output_grid`"
msgstr ""
"使用 :func:`~isaaclab.utils.images.normalize_camera_output_for_display` "
"对各输出进行显示归一化，再通过 :func:`~isaaclab.utils.images.make_camera_output_grid` "
"将所选视图拼成一张图像网格"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:75
msgid ""
"writes the grid to TensorBoard or to disk as a PNG, depending on "
"``--capture_env_sensors_format``"
msgstr ""
"根据 ``--capture_env_sensors_format`` ，将网格写入 TensorBoard 或保存为磁盘上的 PNG 文件"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:77
msgid ""
"Sensors with ``None`` for a given data type are skipped. Only tasks that "
"define scene sensors with image-like outputs (such as camera-based RL "
"environments) produce captured frames."
msgstr ""
"如果某种数据类型的传感器输出为 ``None`` ，则跳过它。只有定义了图像类场景传感器输出的任务（例如基于相机的强化学习环境）才会生成采集帧。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:82
msgid "Command-line options"
msgstr "命令行选项"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:84
msgid ""
"The training entrypoints register the capture flags in "
"``add_common_train_args``:"
msgstr "训练入口在 ``add_common_train_args`` 中注册采集参数："

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:92
msgid "Capture schedule"
msgstr "采集时机"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:94
msgid ""
"A frame is saved on every environment reset and after each step while the "
"current **per-episode** step is inside an active capture window. The episode"
" step counter resets to ``0`` on every environment reset. A step is inside "
"the window when:"
msgstr ""
"每次环境重置时，以及当前 **回合内的** 步数位于有效采集窗口内时的每一步之后，都会保存一帧。每次环境重置都会将回合步数计数器重置为 ``0`` "
"。满足以下条件时，该步位于采集窗口内："

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:102
msgid ""
"For example, with ``--capture_env_sensors_length 100`` and "
"``--capture_env_sensors_interval 2000``, the wrapper saves episode steps "
"``0-99`` after each reset. If an episode lasts longer than 2000 steps, "
"another capture window opens at episode steps ``2000-2099``, then "
"``4000-4099``, and so on."
msgstr ""
"例如，设置 ``--capture_env_sensors_length 100`` 和 "
"``--capture_env_sensors_interval 2000`` 后，包装器会在每次重置后保存回合内第 ``0-99`` "
"步的画面。如果一回合超过 2000 步，会在第 ``2000-2099`` 步再次开启采集窗口，随后是 ``4000-4099`` 步，依此类推。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:108
msgid ""
"This schedule uses a **per-episode** step counter. "
":doc:`/source/features/record_video` instead keys off the Gymnasium "
"``RecordVideo`` wrapper's **global** environment-step counter across "
"episodes."
msgstr ""
"该采集计划使用 **每回合内的** 步数计数器，而 :doc:`/source/features/record_video` 根据 Gymnasium "
"``RecordVideo`` 包装器中跨回合累积的 **全局** 环境步数计数器触发。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:113
msgid "Episode indexing"
msgstr "回合索引"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:115
msgid ""
"Each environment reset increments an episode index that starts at ``1`` on "
"the first reset. Captured frames are grouped by this index so consecutive "
"episodes can be compared:"
msgstr "每次环境重置都会递增回合索引，第一次重置时索引为 ``1`` 。采集帧按该索引分组，便于比较连续回合："

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:118
msgid ""
"TensorBoard tags use ``<sensor_name>/<data_type>/episode_<index>`` with a "
"five-digit zero-padded episode index (for example, ``episode_00001``)"
msgstr ""
"TensorBoard 标签使用 ``<sensor_name>/<data_type>/episode_<index>`` ，回合索引补零至五位（例如"
" ``episode_00001`` ）"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:120
msgid ""
"File output uses ``episode_<index>_step_<step>.png`` under each sensor and "
"data-type directory, with a five-digit episode index and an eight-digit step"
" index (for example, ``episode_00001_step_00000042.png``)"
msgstr ""
"文件输出保存在各传感器和数据类型目录下，文件名为 ``episode_<index>_step_<step>.png`` "
"，回合索引为五位，步数索引为八位（例如 ``episode_00001_step_00000042.png`` ）"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:124
msgid ""
"The ``<step>`` value is the per-episode step counter (reset to ``0`` on "
"every environment reset). In TensorBoard, images are logged with "
"``global_step`` set to the total number of environment steps since training "
"started."
msgstr ""
"``<step>`` 是回合内的步数计数器（每次环境重置时归零）。在 TensorBoard 中记录图像时， ``global_step`` "
"设置为从训练开始累计的环境总步数。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:130
msgid "Image processing"
msgstr "图像处理"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:132
msgid ""
"Before tiling, each selected environment view is passed through "
":func:`~isaaclab.utils.images.normalize_camera_output_for_display`, which "
"maps common camera data types to a ``[0, 1]`` float range suitable for PNG "
"export:"
msgstr ""
"拼接之前，各所选环境视图会经过 "
":func:`~isaaclab.utils.images.normalize_camera_output_for_display` "
"处理，将常见相机数据类型映射为适合导出 PNG 的 ``[0, 1]`` 浮点范围："

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:136
msgid ""
"``rgb`` and unrecognized output types are divided by ``255`` to produce "
"``[0, 1]`` floats"
msgstr "``rgb`` 和未识别的输出类型除以 ``255`` ，生成 ``[0, 1]`` 范围的浮点数"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:137
msgid ""
"Depth-like outputs (``depth``, ``distance_to_camera``, "
"``distance_to_image_plane``) are divided by their per-frame maximum"
msgstr ""
"深度类输出（ ``depth`` 、 ``distance_to_camera`` 、 ``distance_to_image_plane`` "
"）除以各自的逐帧最大值"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:139
msgid "``albedo`` keeps the first three channels and divides by ``255``"
msgstr "``albedo`` 保留前三个通道并除以 ``255``"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:140
msgid "``normals`` are remapped from ``[-1, 1]`` to ``[0, 1]``"
msgstr "``normals`` 从 ``[-1, 1]`` 重新映射到 ``[0, 1]``"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:141
msgid ""
"``motion_vectors`` are clamped to ``[-1, 1]``, remapped to ``[0, 1]``, and "
"packed into the RG channels of an RGB image (B channel set to zero)"
msgstr ""
"``motion_vectors`` 先截断至 ``[-1, 1]`` ，再映射到 ``[0, 1]`` ，随后放入 RGB 图像的 R、G 通道（B "
"通道设为零）"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:144
msgid ""
":func:`~isaaclab.utils.images.make_camera_output_grid` arranges the "
"``capture_num_envs`` views into a roughly square grid (``nrow = "
"round(sqrt(num_envs))``) before the image is written."
msgstr ""
"写入图像前， :func:`~isaaclab.utils.images.make_camera_output_grid` 将 "
"``capture_num_envs`` 个视图排列成近似正方形的网格（ ``nrow = round(sqrt(num_envs))`` ）。"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:149
msgid "Output formats"
msgstr "输出格式"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:151
msgid ""
"**TensorBoard (default).** Each sensor output is logged as a separate image "
"series per episode with the tag "
"``<sensor_name>/<data_type>/episode_<index>``. View the captures alongside "
"other training metrics by pointing TensorBoard at the training log directory"
" or the ``sensor_frames/train`` subdirectory:"
msgstr ""
"**TensorBoard（默认）。** 每个传感器输出按回合记录为独立的图像序列，标签为 "
"``<sensor_name>/<data_type>/episode_<index>`` 。将 TensorBoard 指向训练日志目录或 "
"``sensor_frames/train`` 子目录，即可将采集画面与其他训练指标一起查看："

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:170
msgid ""
"**File.** PNG images are written per sensor, data type, episode, and step:"
msgstr "**文件。** 按传感器、数据类型、回合和步数写入 PNG 图像："

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:172
msgid "``<sensor_name>/<data_type>/episode_<index>_step_<step>.png``"
msgstr "``<sensor_name>/<data_type>/episode_<index>_step_<step>.png``"

#: source/how-to/capture_sensor_frames.rst:174
msgid ""
"Sensor and data-type names are sanitized for file output so they are safe as"
" path components. For example, a frame from the first episode at step ``42``"
" for sensor ``front/camera`` and data type ``rgb`` is written as "
"``front_camera/rgb/episode_00001_step_00000042.png``."
msgstr ""
"写入文件时会清理传感器和数据类型名称，确保它们可安全用作路径组成部分。例如，传感器 ``front/camera`` 的 ``rgb`` "
"数据类型在第一回合第 ``42`` 步的画面，会保存为 "
"``front_camera/rgb/episode_00001_step_00000042.png`` 。"

